<title>UK: Sears Roebuck prices $500 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sears Roebuck prices $500 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, lead manager Goldman Sachs said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SEARS ROEBUCK ACCEPTANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    15.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.637    PAY DATE   *01.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.45	REOFFER    99.637    SPREAD     +62.5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DELAWARE  HOME CTRY  U.S.A     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  30 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 2007 U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p> NOTES     *SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
